--Description: Earlier no rows were returned because I excluded promo_ids that appear in
--             the promotions table, yet all promo_ids in sales do exist there—including
--             999, which the promotions table itself labels “NO PROMOTION”.
--             Therefore, rows with promo_id = 999 represent sales with no promotion.
--             Re-run the city-level aggregation for Q4-2019 using only those rows.
